	2060 [label="Bah! If you did not wish to be privy to the inner workings of my mind, you should not have gone poking about. You are entirely to blame for that.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2060 -> 2064;
	2061 [label="I am quite glad you enjoy my wanderings. This is precisely why I choose to speak as little as I do. Can you imagine enduring this in person? Marie would have put me down years ago like a mad dog.",shape=box,color=blue];
		2061 -> 2064;
